    correctivePlan: ['Base management on a plant-linked laboratory result and current crop, site, and jurisdiction requirements rather than on orange color alone.', 'Contain confirmed diseased foliage and clean tools or handling surfaces as locally appropriate, then monitor tagged plants for new pustules.', 'Reassess the diagnosis if new lesions lack compatible lower-surface pustules or repeated representative microscopy does not support rust.'],
